          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Get in touch with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to book immersive sound bath experiences in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. \\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#0f1720;--bg2:#071021;--accent:#b38bff;--muted:#9aa4b2;--card:#0b1220;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--radius:14px}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#e9eef8}\\n    body{background-image:url('/assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:280px;line-height:1.45}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 48px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#66d5ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#082032;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:rgba(233,238,248,0.85);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{max-width:960px;margin:28px auto;padding:36px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    .hero p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .section-title{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    ul.info{padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0;color:#cfe8ff}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:999px;color:#dbefff;font-weight:600}\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    input,select,textarea{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:#eaf4ff}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#66d5ff);color:#042033;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin:36px 48px 48px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\\n    a.cta-link{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.hero{margin:20px;padding:20px}header{padding:18px}footer{padding:18px;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"/index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n    <h1>Reach out — let's tune your next restoration</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Friendly, focused, and crafted for deep listening. Message {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to ask about classes, corporate waves, or a tailored 1:1 reset in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"layout\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">How we connect</div>\\n        <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Prefer text? Call or email us and we'll respond within 48 hours. For urgent bookings, use the phone number below.</p>\\n        <ul class=\\\"info\\\">\\n          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></li>\\n          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>\\n          <li><strong>Studio / Venue:</strong> {{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>\\n        </ul>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">Quick note — what to bring</div>\\n          <ul class=\\\"info\\\">\\n            <li>Yoga mat or thick blanket, cozy layers, and an eye pillow.</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle and any small props (blocks, straps) you prefer.</li>\\n            <li>Optional: small journal for reflections after the sound bath.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">Contraindications (please read)</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Sound baths are gentle but immersive. If you are pregnant, have epilepsy, recent ear surgery, severe PTSD, or are under active psychiatric treatment, contact {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} before booking. This is informational only and not medical advice.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">Session flow</div>\\n          <ol class=\\\"info\\\">\\n            <li>Welcome & brief intake — share intentions (5–7 min).</li>\\n            <li>Guided settling and breath work (6–10 min).</li>\\n            <li>Immersive soundscape using monochord, chimes, and tuning forks (35–45 min).</li>\\n            <li>Slow return & integration with tea or reflection (8–12 min).</li>\\n          </ol>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">Contact form</div>\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"POST\\\">\\n          <input name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your full name\\\" required />\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" required />\\n          <input name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone (optional)\\\" />\\n          <select name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"event\\\">Public event</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"1to1\\\">1:1 session</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"couples\\\">Couples</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"corporate\\\">Corporate / Team</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"other\\\">Other inquiry</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us what you're looking for (dates, group size, questions)\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Or call <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">Upcoming</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Next public circle: <strong>{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong>. See the full calendar under <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-title\\\">Instruments you might hear</div>\\n          <ul class=\\\"info\\\">\\n            <li>Monochord hums that anchor the field.</li>\\n            <li>Tuning forks for focused resonance and subtle bodywork.</li>\\n            <li>Soft chimes to punctuate transitions and invitations to breath.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Facilitated by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} • {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n      <div>Questions? <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\"><a href=\\\"/book.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-link\\\">Book a session</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Lightweight form handler: simulate redirect to CTA URL\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      // In a real setup, post to server. Here we simulate the intensive offer flow.\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      const url = this.action || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';\\n      const formData = new FormData(this);\\n      // Basic validation done; redirect with a small query token to indicate intent.\\n      const params = new URLSearchParams();\\n      formData.forEach((v,k)=>params.append(k,v));\\n      window.location.href = url + (url.includes('?')? '&':'?') + params.toString();\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# sound_bath — contact page (chunk 4)\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and a README for the sound bath site scaffold.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — full contact / booking page tailored to the \\\"zen_minimal\\\" layout and \\\"playful_premium\\\" voice.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\n- {{VENUE_NAME}}\\n- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n\\nNotes & implementation details:\\n- Visual richness is provided via CSS gradients and a tiled SVG background expected at /assets/img/pattern.svg. Supply a unique pattern.svg for the site to complete the look.\\n- The contact page includes sensory copy: \\\"what to bring\\\", contraindications disclaimer, and a clear session flow. Instruments listed are intentionally varied (monochord, tuning forks, chimes) to avoid repetition across pages.\\n- Navigation labels are tuned to differ from other templates (\\\"Gatherings\\\", \\\"Private\\\", \\\"Rates\\\"). Ensure other pages use slightly different labels to satisfy uniqueness requirements.\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} and redirects there with query params for a lightweight simulated booking flow.\\n- No external fonts or CDNs are used — replace fonts in CSS if you add local assets.\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\n- Uses semantic HTML and sufficient color contrast for a premium, sensory palette. Test with real content and ensure placeholders are sanitized when replaced.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1. Replace placeholders in contact.html with real values.\\n2. Ensure /assets/img/pattern.svg exists and is a unique SVG pattern.\\n3. Serve the static files (any static host or local server) and verify form redirect behavior.\\n\\nDesign knobs to tune:\\n- Root CSS variables (accent, colors, radius) are declared in :root.\\n- Adjust background-size in the body style to control pattern density.\\n\\nGenerated with layoutFamily=zen_minimal, voiceFamily=playful_premium, offerModel=intensive.\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
